    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore the open campus world and spend your four-year student life. As a member of the Game Development Club, grow into a qualified game developer alongside your club members.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in campus events, complete academic courses, earn living expenses and tuition fees, navigate campus survival, and graduate successfully;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classrooms, dorms, shops, clubs... Engage with diverse environments where day-night cycles and seasonal changes dynamically reshape the world over time;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather game design inspiration from daily life, collaborate with club members, and collectively complete game development projects;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance personal skills, encounter diverse characters on broader stages, and explore the campus's layered past and unfolding future.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore the open campus world and spend your four-year student life. As a member of the Game Development Club, grow into a qualified game developer alongside your club members.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in campus events, complete academic courses, earn living expenses and tuition fees, navigate campus survival, and graduate successfully;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classrooms, dorms, shops, clubs... Engage with diverse environments where day-night cycles and seasonal changes dynamically reshape the world over time;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather game design inspiration from daily life, collaborate with club members, and collectively complete game development projects;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance personal skills, encounter diverse characters on broader stages, and explore the campus's layered past and unfolding future.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Freely explore the open campus world and spend your four-year student life. As a member of the Game Development Club, grow into a qualified game developer alongside your club members.",
